ull-body rear view. With her back to the camera and both of her own hands resting on her waist and hips, she holds a wide stance with bent knees and swings her hips from side to side while dropping into a squat, the camera slightly tilted. Staying in the wide stance she keeps pushing her hips out to each side, then lifts her body slightly with her hands still at her sides. The camera moves back in toward her hips at the end, where the impact points show orange-red glints and sparks. The whole clip is one continuous hip-swinging run of catching rounds. The source clip's action order, camera movement, screen side, timing and room are kept, while the original face, the original costume and the Kotte Animation letter watermark are not kept.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, long wavy black hair, glasses, coral pink embroidered long dress, sheer gold-embroidered shawl and gold necklace are retained exactly as given by the identity reference, and both her low-angle hip close-up and her rear full-body view stay covered by that same dress and shawl, while she performs the source clip's actions and keeps the source clip's timing.\n<Video 1>: partially_preserved - the actions, camera movement, framing, screen side, timing and room are retained, while the original performer's face, the original costume and the Kotte Animation letter watermark are not retained and are not reproduced.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video keeps the source clip's stylized 3D animated rendering, its warm interior lighting and its original camera language; only the person in the footage is replaced. The letter watermark reading Kotte Animation is not kept and is not reproduced anywhere in the frame. The room itself is not altered, and the wallpaper and the wall calendar on the wall stay as they are.\n[Shot 1] From 00:00.000 to 00:00.300, a low-angle close view fills the frame with the hips of <Subject 1> as glowing rounds strike the embroidered coral pink skirt of her dress, throwing bright points and orange sparks outward in several directions, the sheer gold-bordered hem of the skirt lifted by the impacts.\n[Shot 2] From 00:00.300 to 00:00.850, the camera pulls back to a full-body view from behind her. She stands with her back to the camera, both of her own hands resting on her waist and hips, her legs opened wide with the knees bent, and she swings her hips from left to right while dropping into a squat. The camera tilts slightly as she moves, and the broken opening in the wall in front of her and the pink armchair behind her in the same room come into view; the gold-bordered shawl lies across her shoulders and her long wavy black hair falls down her back.\n[Shot 3] From 00:00.850 to 00:01.200, staying in the wide-leg stance, she keeps pushing her hips out toward one side and then the other, then lifts her body slightly higher while her hands stay at the sides of her waist, the embroidered skirt and its gold border swinging around her thighs.\n[Shot 4] From 00:01.200 to 00:01.625, the camera comes back in toward her hips, which keep swinging as rounds hit them, orange-red glints and sparks flaring off the embroidered coral pink fabric. She never stands still and never breaks out of this continuous hip-swinging movement.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor room tone with a continuous stream of gunfire cracking against her hips and the embroidered pink fabric, ricochet sparks hissing off in different directions, and the rustle of the dress and shawl as she squats, swings and shifts her weight.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [916.1142578125, 528.8655395507812], "pos": [-2494.423828125, 5574.02001953125], "id": 218, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_conn